{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“拟射影簇”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"拟射影簇"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>拟射影簇 (quasi-projective variety) 是"},{"Local":{"url":"射影簇","text":"射影簇"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"开嵌入","text":"开子簇"}},{"Plain":", 也即射影空间的"},{"Local":{"url":"局部闭嵌入","text":"局部闭子集"}},{"Plain":", 也即射影空间中一个 Zariski 开集与一个 Zariski 闭集的交.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"代数簇","text":"代数簇"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}